---
title: CI — High Level (why Jenkins exists)
---
flowchart LR
    dev([You: edit Django code]) --> commit[git commit / push]
    commit --> trig{{Jenkins triggered}}

    subgraph CI["Jenkins CI server (jenkins/ container, port 8080)"]
        direction TB
        co[Checkout code] --> build[Build Docker image] --> test[Run test suite]
    end

    trig --> co
    test --> pass{All tests pass?}
    pass -- yes --> green["✅ image taskboard:latest<br/>is known-good, deployable"]
    pass -- no --> red["❌ stop — broken code<br/>never reaches deploy"]

    green -.-> run["Run app anywhere<br/>(app/docker-compose.yml)"]

    classDef done fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#22543d;
    classDef warn fill:#fefcbf,stroke:#744210;
    class CI,green done
    class red warn
